":"Best practices","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-shortcuts#Best-practices","line":23},{"title":"Adding parameters to an app intent","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppIntents/Adding-parameters-to-an-app-intent","line":27},{"title":"A diagram of the activation phrase of a shortcut for ordering a drink from a coffee app. The activation phrase contains an optional value for the name of the drink, which is underlined and called out as the shortcut's parameter.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/30601265724ed100cf9fbbe64c8b9c9c/app-intents-parameter-diagram%402x.png","line":29,"embedded":true},{"title":"Siri","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/siri","line":33},{"title":"`SiriTipUIView`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppIntents/SiriTipUIView","line":35},{"title":"Responding to App Shortcuts","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-shortcuts#Responding-to-App-Shortcuts","line":37},{"title":"`ShowsSnippetView`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppIntents/ShowsSnippetView","line":41},{"title":"Live Activities","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/live-activities","line":43},{"title":"`LiveActivityIntent`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppIntents/LiveActivityIntent","line":43},{"title":"A screenshot of the iPhone Home Screen with a custom snippet occupying the top half of the screen. The snippet includes buttons to confirm or cancel a delivery order from a coffee shop, along with the items in the order and the total price.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/05c70d4c5b6a1d65a1ea0a1662b5aa83/app-shortcuts-siri-dialogue%402x.png","line":48,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the iPhone Home Screen with a Live Activity occupying the top quarter of the screen. The Live Activity shows the estimated time for the arrival of a delivery of an order from a coffee shop, along with the number of items in the order and a button to contact the delivery driver.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/62d4ff80b64dba56a083468c467fdb64/app-shortcuts-live-activity%402x.png","line":50,"embedded":true},{"title":"`init(full:supporting:systemImageName:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppIntents/IntentDialog/init\\(full:supporting:systemImageName:\\","line":52},{"title":"Editorial guidelines","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-shortcuts#Editorial-guidelines","line":54},{"title":"`AppShortcutPhrase`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppIntents/AppShortcutPhrase","line":56},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-shortcuts#Platform-considerations","line":62},{"title":"iOS, iPadOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-shortcuts#iOS-iPadOS","line":66},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols","line":68},{"title":"A partial screenshot showing search results in Spotlight on iPhone, including the Top Hit area at the top of the screen with the Suggestions area beneath it. The Notes app appears as the Top Hit, with App Shortcuts appearing in a row to the right of the app icon: one titled New Note with a symbol of a pencil diagonally over a square, one titled Quick Note with a symbol of a scribbled line on a canvas, and one with a thumbnail of an embedded image for a recent note titled Nature. The Suggestions area includes a link to a web search for 'not,' and suggested autocomplete terms 'noteworthy' and 'notes'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/11e4814bf124943b889fc4f56a025431/app-shortcuts-spotlight-search-top-hit%402x.png","line":70,"embedded":true},{"title":"Live Activities",